<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj retail sales fall 2.4 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj retail sales fall 2.4 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Wednesday released the following retail sales data for February 1997.</p>
<p>Revised from figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    Feb 1997		  Jan 1997	     Feb 1996</p>
<p>    -2.4 pct		 +2.8 (+3.4) pct     +3.0 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    Feb 1997		  Jan 1997	     Feb 1996</p>
<p>    -3.5 pct		  +2.4 pct	     +8.6 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
